WEBVTT

00:00:03.343 --> 00:00:04.783
(GASPS)

00:00:07.943 --> 00:00:09.103
(SQUEAKS)

00:00:09.263 --> 00:00:10.463
(GASPS)

00:00:15.103 --> 00:00:17.503
Aaah! (GASPS)

00:00:18.343 --> 00:00:19.463
Aaah!

00:00:19.543 --> 00:00:22.343
-(GASPS)
-Mama!

00:00:23.303 --> 00:00:27.423
From now on, you must take
good care of your toys!

00:00:27.503 --> 00:00:31.663
Because if you don't,
we'll find out, Sid.

00:00:32.143 --> 00:00:38.063
We toys can see everything.

00:00:39.183 --> 00:00:41.623
So play nice.

00:00:41.663 --> 00:00:43.823
Aaah!

00:00:46.823 --> 00:00:51.463
Ha-ha! We did it!
We did it! Ha-ha! Yes!

00:00:51.503 --> 00:00:54.143
The toys!
The toys are alive!

00:00:54.463 --> 00:00:57.703
N-Nice toy.
Aaah!

00:00:58.463 --> 00:01:01.063
-(WHIMPERS)
-What's wrong, Sid?

00:01:01.143 --> 00:01:03.863
-Don't you want to play with Sally?
-(SID SOBBING)

00:01:05.023 --> 00:01:07.223
Nice work, fellows.
Good job.

00:01:07.303 --> 00:01:09.903
Comin' out of the ground, what a touch.
That was a stroke of genius.

00:01:09.983 --> 00:01:11.703
Woody.

00:01:13.143 --> 00:01:15.743
-Thanks.
-(HORN HONKS)

00:01:16.263 --> 00:01:18.023
MOTHER:
Everybody say, "Bye, house!"

00:01:18.103 --> 00:01:20.463
-Woody! The van!
-ANDY: Bye, house.

00:01:20.663 --> 00:01:22.383
(GRUNTS)

00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:24.703
We gotta run! Thanks, guys!

00:01:25.583 --> 00:01:26.583
(CAR DOOR SLIDES CLOSED) (CAR DOOR SLIDES CLOSED)

00:01:26.823 --> 00:01:28.503
(IGNITION STARTING)

00:01:28.543 --> 00:01:31.903
-Quick!
-(GRUNTS)

00:01:31.983 --> 00:01:34.823
(ENGINE REVVING)

00:01:34.903 --> 00:01:36.903
Just go. I'll catch up.

00:01:42.223 --> 00:01:44.263
(GRUNTS)

00:01:48.863 --> 00:01:51.303
(TRUCK APPROACHING)

00:01:51.503 --> 00:01:53.503
BOTH: Aaah!

00:01:58.263 --> 00:01:59.543
Come on!

00:02:04.383 --> 00:02:06.303
(GROWLS)

00:02:14.223 --> 00:02:16.863
-(GRUNTS)
-You can do it, Woody!

00:02:17.463 --> 00:02:21.063
(GRUNTS) I got it! Woo-hoo-hoo!

00:02:21.143 --> 00:02:22.223
-(SCUD BARKING)
-I made it.

00:02:22.263 --> 00:02:23.543
-(GASPS)

00:02:25.543 --> 00:02:30.423
Aaah! Get away,
you stupid dog! Down!

00:02:30.503 --> 00:02:33.103
-Down! Aah! Aah!
-Hold on, Woody!

00:02:34.383 --> 00:02:36.823
(GRUNTS)
I can't do it.

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:40.223
-(CLOTH RIPPING)
-Take care of Andy for me!

00:02:40.263 --> 00:02:43.103
-No!
-(YELPS)

00:02:43.183 --> 00:02:45.623
-Buzz!
-(SNARLING)

00:03:03.223 --> 00:03:06.943
(SNARLING, BARKING)

00:03:07.503 --> 00:03:10.783
-(GRUNTS)
-(SCUD BARKING)

00:03:11.543 --> 00:03:13.063
-Ow!
-Are we there already?

00:03:13.103 --> 00:03:14.623
-Woody?
-How did you...?

00:03:14.743 --> 00:03:16.063
-How'd he get here?
-Where have you...?

00:03:16.143 --> 00:03:17.383
-What happened?
-Ow!

00:03:17.423 --> 00:03:19.623
-What's goin' on?
-What's he takin'?

00:03:19.743 --> 00:03:21.783
Aha! There you are!

00:03:21.823 --> 00:03:25.103
-Hey. What's he doing?
-(WHIMPERS)

00:03:25.783 --> 00:03:28.543
-Aah!
-He's at it again!

00:03:31.623 --> 00:03:33.703
-(BARKS)
-(HORN BEEPING)

00:03:34.423 --> 00:03:36.783
-(BARKING)
-(ENGINE REVVING)

00:03:36.823 --> 00:03:38.543
Ha, ha, ha!

00:03:39.943 --> 00:03:42.143
-Get him!
-Come on!

00:03:42.783 --> 00:03:45.223
(GASPS)

00:03:46.303 --> 00:03:48.983
(BARKING)

00:03:49.063 --> 00:03:52.263
-(ROARS)
-Ah, ah, no, no!

00:03:52.703 --> 00:03:53.743
(BARKS)

00:03:54.783 --> 00:03:55.823
(BARKS)

00:03:56.023 --> 00:03:58.303
No, no, no, no! Wait!
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:03:58.383 --> 00:04:01.303
-(BARKS)
-Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:04:01.383 --> 00:04:03.983
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!
(GROANS)

00:04:04.063 --> 00:04:06.383
(BARKS, PANTS)

00:04:06.503 --> 00:04:08.703
-Pig pile!
-(GRUNTS)

00:04:19.663 --> 00:04:21.183
Aaah!

00:04:21.623 --> 00:04:24.823
(HORN HONKING,
TIRES SCREECHING)

00:04:28.503 --> 00:04:30.183
-(BARKING)
-(HORNS HONKING)

00:04:30.223 --> 00:04:32.543
WOMAN: Get outta that car!
MAN: Move it!

00:04:33.743 --> 00:04:34.703
Whew.

00:04:34.823 --> 00:04:36.743
No! Please!
You don't understand!

00:04:36.823 --> 00:04:38.903
Buzz is out there.
We gotta help him.

00:04:38.983 --> 00:04:41.343
-No!
-Toss him overboard!

00:04:41.383 --> 00:04:43.583
No, no, no!
Wait! Aah!

00:04:45.583 --> 00:04:48.063
-Hooray!
-So long, Woody!

00:04:48.143 --> 00:04:49.783
-(SIGHS)
-(HORN HONKING)

00:04:49.863 --> 00:04:51.943
Aah!

00:04:53.263 --> 00:04:55.343
Oh! Woody!

00:04:55.703 --> 00:04:58.663
-Oh! Well, thanks for the ride.
-Look out!

00:04:58.703 --> 00:05:00.863
Aaah!

00:05:02.423 --> 00:05:04.823
-Now let's catch up to that truck.
-(BEEPS)

00:05:07.663 --> 00:05:11.263
(CHATTERING, LAUGHING)

00:05:12.223 --> 00:05:14.863
Guys! Guys! Woody's riding R.C.

00:05:14.903 --> 00:05:17.063
-What?
-And Buzz is with him!

00:05:20.743 --> 00:05:22.463
-(HORN BEEPING)
-It is Buzz!

00:05:22.543 --> 00:05:24.583
Woody was telling the truth.

00:05:24.623 --> 00:05:28.063
-What have we done?
-Great! Now I have guilt.

00:05:28.103 --> 00:05:30.223
We're almost there!

00:05:31.423 --> 00:05:33.663
Rocky, the ramp!

00:05:36.423 --> 00:05:38.343
(GRUNTS)

00:05:41.423 --> 00:05:42.783
Look out!

00:05:43.583 --> 00:05:45.983
Quick! Hold onto my tail!

00:05:51.063 --> 00:05:56.103
-Attaboy, Slink!
-Oh! Woody!

00:05:56.503 --> 00:05:57.503
Woody! Speed up!

00:05:57.583 --> 00:05:59.543
-Speed up!
-The batteries!

00:05:59.583 --> 00:06:01.263
They're runnin' out!

00:06:01.423 --> 00:06:03.343
SLINKY:
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:06:04.623 --> 00:06:07.943
Whoa! Aah!

00:06:08.143 --> 00:06:09.863
TIMON AND PUMBAA:
♪ Hakuna Matata

00:06:10.503 --> 00:06:12.583
♪ What a wonderful phrase ♪

00:06:12.623 --> 00:06:14.703
-(GIGGLES)
-Aaah!

00:06:17.263 --> 00:06:21.583
-I can't hold on much longer.
-Slink! Hang on!

00:06:22.143 --> 00:06:24.783
-Aaah!
-Ouch!

